# bikepackid backend — manual API testing
#
# Dibaca kulala.nvim (atau REST Client di VS Code, format filenya sama).
# `###` misahin tiap request jadi block independen — taro kursor di dalam
# satu block terus jalanin (kulala.nvim: <leader>rr default, cek `:h kulala`
# kalau beda di config kamu).
#
# @session harus diisi manual dulu abis login (lihat block paling atas) —
# gak ada auto-extract cookie dari response di sini, tetep manual copy dari
# DevTools browser (lihat alasannya: JWT cuma pernah dikirim sekali lewat
# Set-Cookie, sengaja gak pernah balik lagi lewat response body/endpoint
# manapun).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@session = ganti-dengan-value-cookie-dari-devtools
# Diisi manual dari response setelah bikin journey/checkpoint (lihat block
# "Bikin journey baru"/"Tambah checkpoint" di bawah) — sama kayak @session,
# harus di sini (sebelum ### manapun) biar ke-pakai di semua block, bukan
# cuma block tempat dia didefinisikan.
@journeyId = ganti-dengan-uuid-journey
@checkpointId = ganti-dengan-uuid-checkpoint

### Health check (gak butuh auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Versi commit yang lagi jalan (gak butuh auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/version

### Login — buka ini di BROWSER (bukan lewat kulala), Google butuh redirect
### interaktif. Abis sukses, ambil cookie `session` dari DevTools, paste ke
### @session di atas.
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/google/login

### Profil user yang lagi login
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Cookie: session={{session}}

### Contoh route khusus role creator+
GET {{baseUrl}}/app/status
Cookie: session={{session}}

### Semua journey milik saya, termasuk draft (satu-satunya tempat draft
### nongol di list, bukan cuma bisa diambil satu-satu lewat /journeys/:id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/journeys
Cookie: session={{session}}

### Logout (revoke sesi ini doang)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Cookie: session={{session}}

### Logout dari semua device (revoke semua sesi milik user ini)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/sign-out-everywhere
Cookie: session={{session}}

### === Journey ===

### List journey publik (gak wajib login, exclude draft)
GET {{baseUrl}}/journeys?limit=20&offset=0

### Bikin journey baru (role creator+, selalu mulai draft)
POST {{baseUrl}}/journeys
Cookie: session={{session}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bandung ke Yogyakarta",
  "description": "Trip pertama"
}

### Detail satu journey (404 kalau draft & bukan owner/moderator)
GET {{baseUrl}}/journeys/{{journeyId}}
Cookie: session={{session}}

### Update journey (owner atau moderator+) — publish butuh lat/lng lengkap
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/journeys/{{journeyId}}
Cookie: session={{session}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "published",
  "start_lat": -6.9,
  "start_lng": 107.6,
  "end_lat": -7.8,
  "end_lng": 110.4
}

### === Checkpoint ===

### List checkpoint sebuah journey
GET {{baseUrl}}/journeys/{{journeyId}}/checkpoints
Cookie: session={{session}}

### Tambah checkpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/journeys/{{journeyId}}/checkpoints
Cookie: session={{session}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lat": -6.9,
  "lng": 107.6,
  "captured_at": "2026-09-22T10:00:00Z",
  "title": "Start"
}

### === Post ===

### List post sebuah checkpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/checkpoints/{{checkpointId}}/posts
Cookie: session={{session}}

### Posting teks
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkpoints/{{checkpointId}}/posts
Cookie: session={{session}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "text",
  "body": "Berangkat!"
}

### === Upload foto ===

### 1. Minta presigned URL — hasilnya {upload_url, public_url}
POST {{baseUrl}}/uploads/presign-url
Cookie: session={{session}}

### 2. Upload file langsung ke R2 (ganti upload_url dari response di atas).
### PUT body-nya file mentah — kulala.nvim: `< ./path/ke/foto.jpg` di baris
### body buat baca dari file lokal.
PUT ganti-dengan-upload_url-dari-response-sebelumnya
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./foto-test.jpg

### 3. Posting foto, pakai public_url dari step 1 sebagai media_url
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkpoints/{{checkpointId}}/posts
Cookie: session={{session}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "photo",
  "media_url": "ganti-dengan-public_url-dari-step-1"
}
